{"id":"1c848f413742be8f","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-godel-sentence-construction.md","title":"Gödel Sentence Construction","display":"ex-godel-sentence-construction — Gödel Sentence Construction","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-godel-sentence-construction","aliases":["90-ex-godel-sentence-construction"],"display":"ex-godel-sentence-construction — Gödel Sentence Construction","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-godel-sentence]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-godel-sentence-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-godel-sentence-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-godel-sentence-construction — Gödel Sentence Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>全部语法与可证性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的同一环境；涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 时，还使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 中已声明的有效公理化证明呈示，不从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span> 单独推定公理可枚举。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory satisfying the diagonal-lemma assumptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering and partial decoder)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span> (explicit sufficient assumptions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> (arithmetized provability formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (fixed-point sentence)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\nG\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\nG\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>对固定公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> 应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a>，所得句子就是断言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>；公式、编号和指定变量都使用本文件的共同环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对角引理应用于一元公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(G)}\">\\(\\overline{g(G)}\\)</span> 是对象语言数码；不能把元语言中的编码自然数直接放入公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":